<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Enterprise Design Systems — UXGyan</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="project-styles.css"></head><body><header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="../">UXGyan<span>.</span></a><nav class="nav"><a href="../#work">All projects</a><a href="../about.html">About</a><a href="mailto:gyanart@gmail.com">Contact ↗</a></nav></header><main><section class="case-hero"><p class="case-kicker">04 / DESIGN SYSTEMS · UX STRATEGY · ENTERPRISE</p><h1>Consistency is a product capability.</h1><p class="case-lede">A practical design-system exploration showing how shared tokens and reusable components can improve product coherence without limiting teams.</p><div class="case-meta"><div><span>ROLE</span><strong>Design system exploration</strong></div><div><span>FOCUS</span><strong>Tokens · Components · Governance</strong></div><div><span>USERS</span><strong>Product and engineering teams</strong></div><div><span>FORMAT</span><strong>Interactive playground</strong></div></div></section><div class="case-visual"><div class="showcase" style="background:#e9ebe6"><div class="system-playground"><div class="system-head"><b>UXGyan / COMPONENT PLAYGROUND</b><span>LIVE PREVIEW</span></div><div class="system-content"><aside class="system-controls"><div class="control-group"><label for="primary-color">Primary colour</label><input id="primary-color" type="color" value="#365cf5"></div><div class="control-group"><label for="radius-control">Corner radius</label><input id="radius-control" type="range" min="0" max="24" value="5"></div><div class="control-group"><label for="button-label">Button label</label><input id="button-label" type="text" value="Primary action"></div><p class="demo-muted">Change the controls to update the components.</p></aside><div class="system-preview"><div class="token-strip"><i class="token primary" style="background:#365cf5"></i><i class="token" style="background:#dfe5df"></i><i class="token" style="background:#f0c58e"></i><i class="token" style="background:#263b32"></i></div><button class="sample-button">Primary action</button><button class="sample-button outline">Secondary action</button><input class="sample-input" placeholder="Text field component"><p class="demo-muted">Interactive token and component preview</p></div></div></div></div></div><section class="case-section"><p class="case-label">SYSTEM THINKING</p><h2>Build the rules behind the interface.</h2><p>A design system is more than a component library. It connects design decisions to reusable foundations, documented behaviour, accessibility expectations and a governance model that helps teams evolve the product consistently.</p><div class="case-grid"><article class="case-tile"><b>Foundations</b><p>Colour, typography, spacing, elevation, motion and accessibility tokens.</p></article><article class="case-tile"><b>Components</b><p>Composable controls with documented states, behaviours and usage guidance.</p></article><article class="case-tile"><b>Governance</b><p>Contribution, review, versioning and adoption practices across teams.</p></article></div></section><section class="case-section"><p class="case-label">PLAYGROUND</p><h2>Change a token. See the system respond.</h2><p>Use the controls in the preview to adjust the primary colour, component radius and button label. This small playground demonstrates the relationship between design tokens and reusable UI components.</p></section></main><div class="case-next"><span>BACK TO FIRST PROJECT</span><a href="aiops.html">Integrated AIOps platform ↗</a></div><footer class="case-footer"><a href="../">UXGyan.</a><span>Design systems exploration</span><a href="../#work">All projects ↑</a></footer><script src="project.js"></script></body></html>